{title: Baari}
{artist: Bilal Saeed Momina Mustehsan Coke Studio}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Tennu [G]takeya hosh hi [D]bhul gayi,        [D]Garm garm [G]chaa hath te [D]dul gayi
[D]Hath te dul gayi chaa sajna,        [Bm]Aisi teri nigaah sajna
[G]Jaandi jaandi dasdi jaa tu,        [A]Dil de vich ki tere
[A]Dil de vich ki tere,        Main suneya [D]uchiyan deewara rakhiyan
Ni tu [Bm]dil de chaar chufere,        Naale [G]saambh ke rakhde ae
Koi [A]dilch na laa le dere,        Main suneya [D]pehlaan vi dil tuteya
Dil [Bm]tuteya tera ik waari,        Taain [G]dil di deewaraan te
Tu [A]ik na banaai [D]baari,        [D]Mera bhi dil [Bm]udna chaahe
[G]Par main darni [A]aa,        [D]Main udaa te [Bm]Main hawawa
[G]naale ladni [A]aa x2,        [G]Khwab apne [Bm]apni akhiya
[A]vich sambhale [D]main,        [G]Aise layi te [Bm]dil te apne
[A]laale taal [D]main,        Main uchiya [D]uchiyan diwara rakhiyan
Ni tu [Bm]dil de chaar chufere,        Naale [G]saambh ke rakhde ae
Koi [A]dilch na laa le dere,        Te mera [D]pehlaan ve dil tuteya
Haaye [Bm]tuteya mera ik waari,        Taanhio [G]dil di deewaraan te
Main [A]ik na banaai [D]baari,        [D]Tere layi te [G]saari duniya
[A]naal lad [D]laange,        [D]Tu jiye te [G]teri aayi
[A]aap mar [D]laange,        [G]O.. Tu jiye te teri aayi
[A]aap mar laan [D]ge,        [G]O.. Tu jiye te teri aayi
[A]aap mar laan [D]ge,        Tu karke [D]uchiyan deewaran rakh le
Iss [Bm]dil de chaar chufere,        Bhavein [G]saambh ke rakh le dil
Tere [A]dil ch main laane [D]dere,        Te mera [D]pehlaan ve dil tuteya
